      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "一、生成密钥"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "一生成密钥"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "ssh-keygen -t rsa"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "生成 RSA 密钥对：~/.ssh/id_rsa（私钥）+ ~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub（公钥）。现代系统也常用 -t ed25519（补充）。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "二、免密登录"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "二免密登录"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "ssh-copy-id user@ip"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "将本地公钥推送到远程主机 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys，之后 ssh user@ip 免密登录（需先输入一次密码完成推送）。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "三、config 文件：为多台主机配置快捷登录"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "三config-文件为多台主机配置快捷登录"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "打开配置文件："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "vim ~/.ssh/config"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "示例配置："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "ini",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "Host wotoken\n    HostName 192.168.2.18\n    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_rsa\n    User root\n    Port 22\n    IdentitiesOnly yes\n\nHost bobaotest\n    HostName 192.168.2.1\n    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_rsa\n    User root\n    Port 22\n    IdentitiesOnly yes\n\nHost dev02\n    HostName dev02.senses-ai.com\n    Port        22\n    User        yangqing"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "登录（直接用别名）："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "ssh wotoken\nssh bobaotest\nssh dev02"
      },
      {
